    },
    {
      "name": "Chats",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Chat History",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:3000/api/chats/userA_userB",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "port": "3000",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "chats",
                "userA_userB"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Socket.IO Details",
      "description": "Note: Create a new Socket.IO request in Postman and connect to http://localhost:3000\n\nEVENTS TO EMIT:\n1. 'register': Emit with text 'your_user_id'\n2. 'send_message': Emit JSON -> {\"messageId\": \"msg_123\", \"conversationId\": \"conv_456\", \"senderId\": \"user_A\", \"receiverId\": \"user_B\", \"text\": \"Hello\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-20T07:30:00Z\", \"type\": \"text\"}\n3. 'message_delivered': Emit JSON -> {\"messageId\": \"msg_123\", \"senderId\": \"user_A\", \"receiverId\": \"user_B\", \"conversationId\": \"conv_456\"}\n4. 'message_read': Emit JSON -> same as message_delivered\n5. 'typing': Emit JSON -> {\"senderId\": \"user_A\", \"receiverId\": \"user_B\", \"conversationId\": \"conv_456\"}\n6. 'stop_typing': Emit JSON -> same as typing\n7. 'active_chat': Emit JSON -> {\"conversationId\": \"conv_456\"} (or null to clear)\n8. 'sync_offline_messages': Emit JSON -> {\"messages\": [ <array_of_send_message_objects> ]}\n\nEVENTS TO LISTEN FOR:\n- registered\n- new_message\n- message_status\n- message_delivered\n- message_read\n- typing\n- stop_typing\n- user_online\n- user_offline",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Socket URL (Use in New Socket.IO Request)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:3000",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "port": "3000"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}